From 0a050c33e4f9725b0d19f23fe3fe42142ce308f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HybridGt <hybridgt@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:15:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] Watch: reuse write-watch answers within one submission
 (HybridGt)

Each submission asks the kernel about a range once; later flushes in the
same submission use the journal, and our own title writes are noted.
Unknown writes (Step::Run) start a new epoch. VICTORY_WATCH_EPOCH=0 off.
Diagnostics: copy ranges ranked by time; commit-check and reuse counters.

RTX 4070 Ti, world-frame medians: watch 294 -> 142 ms, frame 1266 -> 1140 ms
(run3 vs run4, more draws in run4). Both runs ended in a device removal.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
